      <div class="Section3"><a name="_cultural_naming_profiles" id="_cultural_naming_profiles"></a>
        <h1 class="Annex"><b>Annex B</b><br/>(informative)<br/><br/><b>Cultural naming profiles</b></h1>
        <div><a name="_afghan" id="_afghan"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.1 Afghan</p>

