</div>
        <div><a name="_manchu" id="_manchu"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.30 Manchu</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_ce701932-8339-4d2d-8bd9-566673ede5ff" id="_ce701932-8339-4d2d-8bd9-566673ede5ff"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b47f88fe-d913-4976-bdd0-c6b8fb02c5eb" id="_b47f88fe-d913-4976-bdd0-c6b8fb02c5eb"></a>Manchus are called only by their given names.
Manchu clan names (&#x201C;hala&#x201D;) are not used with their personal names,
but occasionally a family name is used.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_10" id="_typical_name_patterns_10"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.30.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.40</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_ccbf2368-7a77-4593-a75e-a19dc9ba041a" id="_ccbf2368-7a77-4593-a75e-a19dc9ba041a"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.41</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_cabaffe2-d5f5-4815-bd93-2f81b82e9b78" id="_cabaffe2-d5f5-4815-bd93-2f81b82e9b78"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.42</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_7cfe6427-4454-437d-9a05-02d286307173" id="_7cfe6427-4454-437d-9a05-02d286307173"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_10" id="_examples_10"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.30.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_45fedd00-7b64-4b32-b38a-446ffde0c473" id="_45fedd00-7b64-4b32-b38a-446ffde0c473"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Tuli&#x161;en&#x201D;</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_2e7ae1bb-b81d-48a1-be03-0219e33539aa" id="_2e7ae1bb-b81d-48a1-be03-0219e33539aa"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Hiowan Ye&#x201D; (&#x7384;&#x70E8;)</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_073f6ea6-6654-4948-a1fe-d1ae51b11568" id="_073f6ea6-6654-4948-a1fe-d1ae51b11568"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  3</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Aisin-Gioro Ulhicun&#x201D;, linguist. The family name is &#x201C;Aisin-Gioro&#x201D;.</p></div></div></div>
        <div><a name="_mongolian" id="_mongolian"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.31 Mongolian</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4f8c2fdf-c266-45b5-904c-d09355b3f1e7" id="_4f8c2fdf-c266-45b5-904c-d09355b3f1e7"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo35;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo35;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    clan name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo35;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo35;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    genonymic name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_54552947-64af-4a52-824f-dd0d9e7d8b87" id="_54552947-64af-4a52-824f-dd0d9e7d8b87"></a>Mongolian names traditionally consists of only one personal name.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_11" id="_typical_name_patterns_11"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.31.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.43</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_3a5fc679-72bb-4f02-8968-4093aa783734" id="_3a5fc679-72bb-4f02-8968-4093aa783734"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">clan name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.44</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_141b94fb-ce6c-47e6-a4df-64d2cccb73b9" id="_141b94fb-ce6c-47e6-a4df-64d2cccb73b9"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.45</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_24c13416-48c5-4dd4-93b3-d4c515298e96" id="_24c13416-48c5-4dd4-93b3-d4c515298e96"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">genonymic name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_11" id="_examples_11"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.31.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_9e85aede-2e8f-4776-aa42-068e084a8410" id="_9e85aede-2e8f-4776-aa42-068e084a8410"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x41E;&#x442;&#x440;&#x44F;&#x434;&#x44B;&#x43D; &#x413;&#x4AF;&#x43D;&#x434;&#x44D;&#x433;&#x43C;&#x430;&#x430; (&#x201C;Otryadyn G&#xFC;ndegmaa&#x201D;), a Mongolian shooter, has &#x201C;Otryadyn&#x201D; as a patronym, &#x201C;G&#xFC;ndegmaa&#x201D; as given name.</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_64c03ba2-6781-4a4f-a0f6-93f763728c7d" id="_64c03ba2-6781-4a4f-a0f6-93f763728c7d"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x425;&#x430;&#x43B;&#x442;&#x43C;&#x430;&#x430;&#x433;&#x438;&#x439;&#x43D; &#x411;&#x430;&#x442;&#x442;&#x443;&#x43B;&#x433;&#x430; (&#x201C;Khaltmaagiin Battulga&#x201D;), President of Mongolia.</p></div></div></div>
