        <div><a name="_thai" id="_thai"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.45 Thai</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_122c7ecf-6329-4f4a-803e-2704d8d1c5fd" id="_122c7ecf-6329-4f4a-803e-2704d8d1c5fd"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo38;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo38;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
