<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_87dc05f1-6cd7-4aed-9cea-e8a9e04ade28" id="_87dc05f1-6cd7-4aed-9cea-e8a9e04ade28"></a>Modern Thai names are composed of given names followed by the family name.
Prior to 1913, family names were not required.</p>
