    <p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2b4b47de-b6dd-4c1e-a683-62e55a319b11" id="_2b4b47de-b6dd-4c1e-a683-62e55a319b11"></a>family name (+ optional additional name(s)) + given name</p>
  </td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Abbreviated</p></td><td valign="top">
    <p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_25204677-bc22-4517-ad48-cbf43880713f" id="_25204677-bc22-4517-ad48-cbf43880713f"></a>given name</p>
  </td></tr></table>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_206da2ef-8bb0-4ee5-853d-6faa4ab3d34d" id="_206da2ef-8bb0-4ee5-853d-6faa4ab3d34d"></a>Vietnamese personal names are names used by those from Vietnam and the Vietnamese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_396bc4ed-ac9a-4303-bd8d-97fd335bb313" id="_396bc4ed-ac9a-4303-bd8d-97fd335bb313"></a>Vietnamese names consist of a family name (T&#xEA;n, &#x20E1B;),
followed by a given name (H&#x1ECD;, /&#x22A5C;).
Between the family name and given name,
one or more additional names may be present.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9d89ea1a-acbb-4be1-8c1a-24d6712199ba" id="_9d89ea1a-acbb-4be1-8c1a-24d6712199ba"></a>Vietnamese additional names can be a
middle name (t&#xEA;n &#x111;&#x1EC7;m),
generational name,
or clan distinguisher name. The middle name, for identification purposes, can be omitted.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_77fc4075-147b-43e2-9097-340dcef7efa2" id="_77fc4075-147b-43e2-9097-340dcef7efa2"></a>Courtesy names are also allowed, separate from the given name.</p>
<div><a name="_examples_15" id="_examples_15"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.48.1 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_7ed900ff-818e-46f8-9965-72884c8ece0e" id="_7ed900ff-818e-46f8-9965-72884c8ece0e"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Birth name of &#x201C;H&#x1ED3; Ch&#xED; Minh&#x201D;:</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.50</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_0209c6ed-cfab-4c88-9be4-f31c34aa53c7" id="_0209c6ed-cfab-4c88-9be4-f31c34aa53c7"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Nguy&#x1EC5;n</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Sinh Cung</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.51</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_83d05774-eb29-40b5-abbf-8e20dc88d9a2" id="_83d05774-eb29-40b5-abbf-8e20dc88d9a2"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">H&#x1ED3;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Ch&#xED; Minh</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_c0b84dcc-842d-4409-874e-6aef1441b3e6" id="_c0b84dcc-842d-4409-874e-6aef1441b3e6"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Another name of &#x201C;H&#x1ED3; Ch&#xED; Minh&#x201D;:</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.52</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_efedf971-40b2-4598-8239-1cf44537aa6b" id="_efedf971-40b2-4598-8239-1cf44537aa6b"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Nguy&#x1EC5;n</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">T&#x1EA5;t Th&#xE0;nh</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_515fc1bf-7997-48e6-82c6-a70d28ad7dba" id="_515fc1bf-7997-48e6-82c6-a70d28ad7dba"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  3</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>A pseudonym of &#x201C;H&#x1ED3; Ch&#xED; Minh&#x201D; (&#x201C;Nguy&#x1EC5;n the Patriot&#x201D;):</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.53</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_ab77546f-3e50-49c7-8e9d-9ec26c6a70d7" id="_ab77546f-3e50-49c7-8e9d-9ec26c6a70d7"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Nguy&#x1EC5;n</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#xC1;i Qu&#x1ED1;c</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_97469096-3b56-41ba-84e2-0fff7cad94bb" id="_97469096-3b56-41ba-84e2-0fff7cad94bb"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  4</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Another name of &#x201C;H&#x1ED3; Ch&#xED; Minh&#x201D; (&#x201C;Nguy&#x1EC5;n the Patriot&#x201D;):</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.54</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_2f84199c-aa1e-44db-b4e6-939b58c4337c" id="_2f84199c-aa1e-44db-b4e6-939b58c4337c"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Nguy&#x1EC5;n</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">V&#x103;n</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Hu&#x1EC7;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">middle name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.55</p><div align="center"><table st